RPT#MATH-864: {
 "summary": "CMAESOptimizer does not enforce bounds"
 "description": "The CMAESOptimizer can exceed the bounds passed to optimize. Looking at the generationLoop in doOptimize(), it does a bounds check by calling isFeasible() but if checkFeasableCount is zero (the default) then isFeasible() is never even called. Also, even with non-zero checkFeasableCount it may give up before finding an in-bounds offspring and go forward with an out-of-bounds offspring."
}

